(7735791, 1275126, 65234, '<td valign="top">Yikes! Beautiful starbursts on the lights but you''re making my palms sweat =:-0 Most unusual light display I''ve seen thus far, and it''s pretty, besides.</td>', 'Yikes! Beautiful starbursts on the lights but you''re making my palms sweat =:-0 Most unusual light display I''ve seen thus far, and it''s pretty, besides.', '2022-12-30 17:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
